        526.9402465820312,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Major challenges were reported relating to the required supply",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        79.11609649658203,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        213.40945434570312,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "Supply chain challenges:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9642333984375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "chain for implementing targeted NGS. Procurement bottlenecks and delays coupled with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        490.3271179199219,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "shelf-life limitations of reagents jeopardize continuous access to specialist supplies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        327.40771484375,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9696044921875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "There were concerns that data analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.81520080566406,
        79.11609649658203,
        128.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        115.81520080566406,
        327.3915100097656,
        128.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Data management and storage requirements:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9862060546875,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "and data storage requirements were not fully developed, including systems for backing up",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9630737304688,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "data, ownership of data and security of data. Another issue that needs to be considered is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        485.048828125,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "how targeted NGS and routine laboratory information systems can be interlinked.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        468.35931396484375,
        177.66119384765625,
        526.9783325195312,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "There was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.81520080566406,
        79.11609649658203,
        190.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        177.81520080566406,
        468.2739562988281,
        190.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Continuous updating of the WHO catalogue of mutations is required:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.16119384765625,
        526.7815551757812,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "agreement that the usefulness of the targeted NGS technology depends on the informational",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.66119384765625,
        526.9660034179688,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "support provided by the WHO catalogue of mutations  , which allows for meaningful  (53)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        224.16119384765625,
        526.9591674804688,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "interpretation of resistance data; thus, there is a need for the WHO catalogue to be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        239.66119384765625,
        195.32411193847656,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "continuously updated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        266.49981689453125,
        78.81920623779297,
        279.64483642578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        266.49981689453125,
        526.9678955078125,
        279.64483642578125
      ],
      "text": "The overall   Feasibility concerns differed for the different targeted NGS platforms:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        281.99981689453125,
        526.7412109375,
        295.14483642578125
      ],
      "text": "sentiment was that all targeted NGS platforms needed to be further developed before",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        297.49981689453125,
        526.9971923828125,
        310.64483642578125
      ],
      "text": "they are fully ready for operational use, some more than others. The high level of technical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        312.99981689453125,
        527.0635375976562,
        326.14483642578125
      ],
      "text": "complexity of the sample preparation stages (mainly the library preparation stage) was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        328.49981689453125,
        526.9864501953125,
        341.64483642578125
      ],
      "text": "considered a key challenge for the Deeplex platform, and the need for improved computer",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        343.99981689453125,
        526.986328125,
        357.14483642578125
      ],
      "text": "analysis and storage capacity was a challenge for the Oxford Nanopore platform, although",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        359.49981689453125,
        526.96435546875,
        372.64483642578125
      ],
      "text": "both required a high level of precision and attention to detail. There is also a need to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        374.99981689453125,
        301.9563903808594,
        388.14483642578125
      ],
      "text": "incorporate steps for early error recognition.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.3460388183594,
        271.55047607421875,
        419.72601318359375
      ],
      "text": "Values, preferences and equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.9770202636719,
        527.0001220703125,
        443.1220397949219
      ],
      "text": "The overall sentiment is that  MDR-TB diagnostic technology needs to balance accuracy,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.4770202636719,
        526.9957885742188,
        458.6220397949219
      ],
      "text": ", and that targeted NGS technology would  speed, affordability, equity and cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.9770202636719,
        526.991943359375,
        474.1220397949219
      ],
      "text": "need to address these considerations before it can be implemented in LMIC settings. These",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.4770202636719,
        527.2373657226562,
        489.6220397949219
      ],
      "text": "considerations were consistent across the different stakeholder groups who participated in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.9770202636719,
        119.0896987915039,
        505.1220397949219
      ],
      "text": "the study.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.1348876953125,
        524.4236450195312,
        529.0488891601562
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Centralized versus decentralized placement may have equity implications for access:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        531.4808959960938,
        526.9207763671875,
        544.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "Given the high-level specialized laboratory infrastructure, specialized human resources and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992347717285156,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        546.9808959960938,
        526.9337158203125,
        560.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "technical complexity needed for targeted NGS, the technology may be suitable for placement",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        562.4808959960938,
        526.9631958007812,
        575.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "only at centralized, reference laboratories. This may have equity access considerations if it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        577.9808959960938,
        526.9970703125,
        591.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "means less access for some regions of a country that lack reference laboratories. This may",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        593.4808959960938,
        526.9864501953125,
        606.6259155273438
      ],
      "text": "also have implications for costs (e.g. costs for transport of sputum), probability of sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        608.9808959960938,
        199.55889892578125,
        622.1259155273438
      ],
      "text": "loss and time to results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.9849243164062,
        526.96630859375,
        646.1299438476562
      ],
      "text": "There was a major concern about  2.\t  Affordability and cost–effectiveness are major concerns:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        648.4849243164062,
        527.0155029296875,
        661.6299438476562
      ],
      "text": "the financial costs of the targeted NGS technology and the affordability for LMIC. Participants",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        663.9849243164062,
        526.9641723632812,
        677.1299438476562
      ],
      "text": "were worried about the cost of the equipment and the costs of ongoing specialist supplies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        679.4849243164062,
        526.9725341796875,
        692.6299438476562
      ],
      "text": "(especially reagents), as well as the cost of maintaining equipment. They noted that costing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991896629333496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        694.9849243164062,
        527.008056640625,
        708.1299438476562
      ],
      "text": "calculations should be comprehensive and should include the cost of special consumables,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        710.4849243164062,
        527.1426391601562,
        723.6299438476562
      ],
      "text": "extra general laboratory consumables and additional infrastructure needs (e.g. extra space,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990595817565918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        725.9849243164062,
        526.99365234375,
        739.1299438476562
      ],
      "text": "temperature control and internet connectivity). There were concerns that cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968153953552246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        741.4849243164062,
        527.002685546875,
        754.6299438476562
      ],
      "text": "calculations should be comprehensive and should include assessment of the impact of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        756.9849243164062,
        357.2525329589844,
        770.1299438476562
      ],
      "text": "use of targeted NGS testing on improving TB outcomes.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 115",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}